---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="WanDigi | The Agentic Local Growth System">
	<section class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-24 px-4 text-center">
		<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-tight mb-6">
			Don't just rank. Be the <span class="text-wandigi-orange">answer</span> and the <span class="text-wandigi-orange">action</span>.
		</h1>
		<p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
			Kami membangun mesin akuisisi pelanggan yang membuat bisnis lokal Anda direkomendasikan oleh AI dan dipilih langsung melalui alat bantu interaktif.
		</p>
		<a href="/audit" class="px-8 py-4 bg-wandigi-blue text-white font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:bg-blue-800 transition-colors text-lg">
			Mulai Analisis Visibilitas AI
		</a>
	</section>
</Layout>